NEMEtheft: Having problems with Master Kaen or lost your best samurai
to the "Muramasa no tsurugi"? Worry no more with a NEMEtheft(tm) kit
you can beat up your quest nemesis with your quest artifact! Or better
yet get The Book of the Dead without ever fighting Rodney!
