1. Making your NEMEtheft kit:
Gather these items and put them in a bag (of holding if possible)
named NEMEtheft kit.The ones marked with an * are Optional.The ones
marked with an X you must pick one of.
Blindfold
Tin of floating eye meat* (if you don't have telepathy)
Some way to confuse yourself 
& Scroll of gold detection
& Unicorn horn* (if you're worried about traps)
Wand of teleportation with 3+ charges
& Ring of teleport controlX
Wand of teleportation
& 2 Blessed scroll of teleportationX
Wand of teleportation
& 2 Uncursed scroll of teleportation
& Ring of teleport controlX
Potion of object detection
Cursed potion of gain level* (if you don't have a way to level
teleport)
2.Using your NEMEtheft Kit:
First get to the stairs on the level before the quest nemesis' level.
Take everything out of your bag. Put on the blindfold and eat the tin
of floating eye meat if you don't have telepathy. Confuse yourself now
if applicable.Then go down stairs.
First find your nemesis. If you're worried about traps, read the
scroll of detect gold and apply the unicorn horn. Teleport to a square
not occupied by a trap or monster. If possible, teleport to a space
within wand zaping range of your nemesis. Then zap your nemesis with
your wand of teleportation and POOF! your nemesis is on one square and
your quest artifact is on another. Quaff the potion of object
detection and teleport to your quest artifact. Pick it up THEN RUN FOR
YOUR LIFE!!
2.1 Using your NEMEtheft kit vs. someone else:
This also works vs Rodney and Vlad. But it's little use against the
Wizard of Yendor because he'll be a pest after you wake him.
3. How it works:
The last level of the quest is generated with your nemesis standing on
the quest artifact. So if you zap the nemesis before it has a chance
to move, you can steal the artifact! This can lead to wild scenarios
like when zap Ashikaga Takauji and a unsuspecting ninja picks up
muramasa-sama, you run away and you forget which ninja has it! You
might ask "Why don't they make The Book of the Dead a part of Rodney's
inventory?" Well if they did, every time the wizard regenerated there
would be another Book of the Dead!Same thing with Vlad.
